---
import type { Locale } from '../../i18n';
import { localePath } from '../../i18n';
import ExternalBrandMark from '../common/ExternalBrandMark';
import { EFFECTIVE_STATE_GDR_LORA_STUDY as study } from '../../data/effectiveStateGdrLoraStudy';
import type { EffectiveStateFormalResult } from '../../data/effectiveStateGdrLoraStudy';

interface Props { locale: Locale }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === 'zh';
const t = (cn: string, en: string) => zh ? cn : en;
const p = (path: string) => localePath(locale, path);
const cap = '/research/seed-openevo/study/capability-exploration';
const boundedHref = p(`${cap}/sd-lora-bounded-state/`);
const gatedHref = p(`${cap}/gated-delta-sd-lora/`);
const vanillaHref = p('/research/seed-openevo/flow/sd-lora/');
const scalingHref = p(`${cap}/sd-lora-scaling/`);
const directApplyHref = p(`${cap}/q17-directapply-analysis/`);
const result = study.formalResult as EffectiveStateFormalResult;
const pending = result.status === 'pending';
const sealed = result.status === 'sealed' ? result : null;

const scoreChart = { left: 44, right: 716, top: 18, bottom: 238, maxRound: 159, maxScore: 100 };
const sx = (round: number) => scoreChart.left + (round / scoreChart.maxRound) * (scoreChart.right - scoreChart.left);
const sy = (score: number) => scoreChart.bottom - (score / scoreChart.maxScore) * (scoreChart.bottom - scoreChart.top);
const moving = (rows: readonly { round: number; score: number }[]) => rows.map((point, index) => {
  const window = rows.slice(Math.max(0, index - 11), index + 1);
  return { round: point.round, score: window.reduce((sum, row) => sum + row.score, 0) / window.length };
});
const points = (rows: readonly { round: number; score: number }[]) => rows.map((d) => `${sx(d.round).toFixed(1)},${sy(d.score).toFixed(1)}`).join(' ');
const offScoreRaw = sealed ? points(sealed.trajectory.off) : '';
const onScoreRaw = sealed ? points(sealed.trajectory.on) : '';
const offScoreTrend = sealed ? points(moving(sealed.trajectory.off)) : '';
const onScoreTrend = sealed ? points(moving(sealed.trajectory.on)) : '';
const lossRows = sealed ? [...sealed.trajectory.off, ...sealed.trajectory.on].filter((d) => d.loss !== null) : [];
const maxLoss = Math.max(1, ...lossRows.map((d) => d.loss ?? 0));
const lossChart = { left: 42, right: 364, top: 18, bottom: 238 };
const lx = (round: number) => lossChart.left + (round / 159) * (lossChart.right - lossChart.left);
const ly = (loss: number) => lossChart.bottom - (loss / maxLoss) * (lossChart.bottom - lossChart.top);
const lossPoints = (rows: readonly { round: number; loss: number | null }[]) => rows.filter((d) => d.loss !== null).map((d) => `${lx(d.round).toFixed(1)},${ly(d.loss ?? 0).toFixed(1)}`).join(' ');
const offLoss = sealed ? lossPoints(sealed.trajectory.off) : '';
const onLoss = sealed ? lossPoints(sealed.trajectory.on) : '';
---

<article class="esg" data-effective-state-gdr-page data-copy-review data-reader-page="research-explainer">
  <header class="esg__hero" data-reader-context id="top">
    <p class="esg__eyebrow">{t('08 · 固定状态之后，控制新经验写多强', '08 · Controlling write strength after bounded state')}</p>
    <h1>Bounded Online Recurrence + Effective-State GDR</h1>
    <p class="esg__lede" data-reader-task data-reader-purpose>{t(
      '160 轮已经全部跑完。最直观的结果来自同一份冻结 128 题：历史 DirectApply 得 60.72，Bounded OFF 得 45.98，Bounded + Effective-State GDR ON 得 20.77。下面再把训练期长期统计、计算时间和参数变化分开解释。',
      'All 160 rounds are complete. The clearest first view comes from the same frozen 128-task final: historical DirectApply scores 60.72, Bounded OFF scores 45.98, and Bounded + Effective-State GDR ON scores 20.77. The rest of the page separates long-horizon training statistics, compute time, and parameter changes.',
    )}</p>
    <div class="esg__facts esg__final-facts" aria-label={t('同一冻结 128 题的三个 Final', 'Three finals on the same frozen 128-task panel')}>
      <div><span>DirectApply · {t('历史前驱', 'historical predecessor')}</span><strong>{study.threeWayFinal.directApply.score.toFixed(2)}</strong><span class="esg__metric-detail">{study.threeWayFinal.directApply.exactCount}/128 exact</span></div>
      <div><span>Bounded OFF</span><strong>{study.threeWayFinal.off.score.toFixed(2)}</strong><span class="esg__metric-detail">{study.threeWayFinal.off.exactCount}/128 exact</span></div>
      <div><span>Bounded + GDR ON</span><strong>{study.threeWayFinal.on.score.toFixed(2)}</strong><span class="esg__metric-detail">{study.threeWayFinal.on.exactCount}/128 exact</span></div>
    </div>
    <p class="esg__status"><strong>{t('正式实验 COMPLETE · Final 与长期训练统计已经封存。', 'Formal study COMPLETE · final and long-horizon statistics are sealed.')}</strong> {t(
      '三种最终模型使用完全相同的冻结 128 题，所以 Final 可以直接并排描述；但 DirectApply 是更早的独立实验，不是这次 OFF / ON 预注册对照的第三条 arm。OFF / ON 的因果比较仍只属于两条匹配 arm。',
      'All three final models use exactly the same frozen 128-task panel, so their final scores can be shown side by side descriptively. DirectApply is an earlier independent experiment, not a third arm of this preregistered OFF/ON comparison; the paired causal contrast remains OFF versus ON only.',
    )}</p>
  </header>

  <section class="esg__section" id="why" aria-labelledby="why-title">
    <h2 id="why-title">{t('为什么 Bounded 以后还要研究写入强度', 'Why write strength still matters after Bounded')}</h2>
    <div class="esg__why-grid">
      <div><strong>{t('Bounded 解决的是', 'Bounded solves')}</strong><p>{t('历史状态大小。旧组件不再无限累积进下一轮。', 'State size. Old components no longer grow without bound into the next round.')}</p></div>
      <div><strong>{t('GDR 要解决的是', 'GDR asks')}</strong><p>{t('新经验该写多少。它控制一次更新进入下一状态的强度。', 'How much new experience should be written into the next state.')}</p></div>
    </div>
    <p>{t(
      '所以“固定历史状态大小”和“控制新经验写入强度”是两个不同问题。前者已经有封存的 Bounded 结果；本页只负责后继方法的推导和新的正式实验。',
      'Keeping state size fixed and controlling write strength are two different problems. The former already has a sealed Bounded result; this page owns only the successor derivation and the new formal experiment for the latter.',
    )}</p>
    <nav class="esg__context-links" aria-label={t('上下文页面', 'Context pages')}>
      <a href={vanillaHref}>{t('Vanilla SD-LoRA 一轮怎么工作', 'How one Vanilla SD-LoRA update works')}</a>
      <a href={scalingHref}>{t('为什么历史越多越慢', 'Why growing history gets slower')}</a>
      <a href={boundedHref}>{t('Bounded rank128 的封存结果', 'Sealed Bounded rank128 result')}</a>
    </nav>
  </section>

  <section class="esg__section" id="representation" aria-labelledby="representation-title">
    <h2 id="representation-title">{t('为什么 LoRA 的内部表示会让控制变得危险', 'Why LoRA coordinates make control tricky')}</h2>
    <p>{t(
      '原始 Gated Delta 只有一个直接更新的状态。LoRA 却把同一个有效更新拆成 A/C 两组因子；同一个 C A^T，可以对应很多不同的 A/C 数值。也就是说，A/C 因子只是内部表示坐标，不等于真正写进模型的更新。',
      'Original Gated Delta controls one directly updated State. LoRA represents the same effective update with A/C factor coordinates; the same C A^T can correspond to many A/C values. The factors are therefore representation coordinates, not the behavioral update object itself.',
    )}</p>
    <figure class="esg__representation" aria-label={t('直接状态与 LoRA 因子表示对比', 'State versus factor representation')}>
      <div class="esg__rep-column">
        <span>{t('直接状态', 'direct state')}</span>
        <div class="esg__node is-state">State</div>
        <div class="esg__solid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="esg__node">write × β</div>
      </div>
      <div class="esg__rep-column">
        <span>{t('LoRA 表示层', 'LoRA representation')}</span>
        <div class="esg__factor-row"><div class="esg__node">A</div><div class="esg__node">C</div></div>
        <div class="esg__dash" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="esg__node is-effective">effective update C A<sup>T</sup></div>
      </div>
    </figure>
    <p class="esg__formula">A → sA，C → C/s；(C/s)(sA)<sup>T</sup> = C A<sup>T</sup>。{t('A/C 因子坐标变了，但真正的有效更新没变。', 'The factor coordinates change, but the effective update does not.')}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="esg__section" id="derivation" aria-labelledby="derivation-title">
    <h2 id="derivation-title">{t('四个决定性台阶', 'Four decisive steps')}</h2>
    <ol class="esg__steps">
      <li>
        <span>01</span><h3>{t('第一代按 A/C 因子控制写入，先撞到表示坐标边界', 'First-generation factor write hits a coordinate-domain boundary')}</h3>
        <p>{t(`Round0 的 C 因子位移给出 βC=${study.derivation.firstGenerationFactorFailure.betaC.toFixed(3)}，已经超出 (0,1)；A 侧 βA=${study.derivation.firstGenerationFactorFailure.betaA.toFixed(3)}。这里的 1.052 是因子位移这层检查值，不是原始或有效状态上的 GDR β。`, `At Round0, the C-factor displacement gives βC=${study.derivation.firstGenerationFactorFailure.betaC.toFixed(3)}, outside (0,1), while βA=${study.derivation.firstGenerationFactorFailure.betaA.toFixed(3)}. The 1.052 value is a factor-displacement gate value, not the original/effective GDR beta.`)}</p>
        <p class="esg__cannot">{t('支持：第一代基于 A/C 因子坐标的写入方式在空历史起点上不合法。不能证明：GDR 思想本身失败。', 'Supports: the first-generation factor-space treatment is invalid at the EMPTY start. Does not prove: GDR as an idea fails.')}</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span>02</span><h3>{t('只改“怎么映射”还不够', 'Fixing the mapping alone is not enough')}</h3>
        <p>{t(`把控制对象改成真正的有效写入后，旧控制器在真实更新轨迹上预测 β_eff=${study.derivation.mappingOnlyControllerFailure.betaEffective.toFixed(3)}，再次超出 (0,1)。这次失败已经不再是 A/C 因子位移的问题，而是旧控制器本身。`, `After switching to an effective-write mapping, the old controller predicts β_eff=${study.derivation.mappingOnlyControllerFailure.betaEffective.toFixed(3)} on the real intervention trajectory, again outside (0,1). This failure is no longer the factor-displacement gate; it is the old controller itself.`)}</p>
        <p class="esg__cannot">{t('支持：旧控制器依赖 A/C 因子坐标特征，不能直接搬到新的有效写入轨迹。', 'Supports: the old controller depends on factor-coordinate features and cannot simply be transplanted to the new intervention trajectory.')}</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span>03</span><h3>{t('第二步必须看到第一步实际写出的 C1', 'The teacher’s second step must see the runtime’s actual C1')}</h3>
        <p>{t('计算第二步时，如果还假设第一步完整走到 Adam 提议的 Cp，但实际运行只写入了受控后的 C1，那么第二步更新 A 时用到的状态就是错的。新的顺序因此固定为：先写 C，得到实际 C1，再基于 C1 更新 A。', 'If the teacher computes step two assuming step one reached the full Adam proposal Cp, while runtime actually wrote the controlled state C1, then the A-write is conditioned on the wrong state. The successor therefore fixes the order: write C first, obtain the actual C1, then compute the A write from C1.')}</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span>04</span><h3>{t('最终改为控制真正影响模型的有效状态和有效写入', 'The final control object becomes effective state / effective write')}</h3>
        <p>{t('同一个 LoRA 更新可以有不同 A/C 内部表示，所以后继方法的 β 控制规则只使用不受 A/C 等比例缩放影响的特征，目标量也改成有效写入大小。LoRA 的 A/C 因子仍然存在，但只作为内部表示。', 'Because the same LoRA update can have different A/C representations, the successor beta policy uses only scalar-gauge-invariant features and targets effective write magnitude. LoRA factors still exist, but only as an implementation representation layer.')}</p>
        <p class="esg__cannot">{t('支持：新的 treatment identity 与 representation choice 解耦。不能证明：正式 WebShop 长周期效果更好。', 'Supports: the new treatment identity is decoupled from representation choice. Does not prove: better long-horizon WebShop efficacy.')}</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
    <details class="esg__details">
      <summary>{t('查看这两层 negative evidence 的固定证据', 'Pinned evidence for the two negative steps')}</summary>
      <ul>
        <li><a href={study.evidence.firstGenerationFactorFailure}><ExternalBrandMark href={study.evidence.firstGenerationFactorFailure} />{study.derivation.firstGenerationFactorFailure.status}</a></li>
        <li><a href={study.evidence.mappingOnlyControllerFailure}><ExternalBrandMark href={study.evidence.mappingOnlyControllerFailure} />{study.derivation.mappingOnlyControllerFailure.status}</a></li>
      </ul>
    </details>
  </section>

  <section class="esg__section" id="method" aria-labelledby="method-title">
    <h2 id="method-title">{t('Effective-State GDR-LoRA v1 怎样写一次更新', 'How Effective-State GDR-LoRA v1 writes an update')}</h2>
    <div class="esg__method-grid">
      <figure class="esg__flow" aria-label={t('Effective-State GDR 顺序写入流程', 'Effective-State GDR sequential write flow')}>
        <div class="esg__flow-node">{t('有效状态', 'effective state')}</div>
        <div class="esg__flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="esg__flow-node">{t('invariant controller', 'invariant controller')}</div>
        <div class="esg__flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="esg__flow-node">β<sub>eff</sub></div>
        <div class="esg__flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="esg__flow-node">C write</div>
        <div class="esg__flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="esg__flow-node is-actual">actual C1</div>
        <div class="esg__flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="esg__flow-node">A write</div>
        <div class="esg__flow-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="esg__flow-node is-state">{t('下一步有效状态', 'next effective state')}</div>
        <figcaption>{t('实线表示真正的状态和写入顺序；A/C 只负责底层表示。', 'Solid connectors are the real state/write flow; A/C remain a lower-level representation.')}</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <aside class="esg__forbidden">
        <h3>{t('这些信号不会控制在线写入', 'These signals do not control online writes')}</h3>
        <p>reward · WebShop score · Task Vector · probe · future state · final panel</p>
        <p><strong>g = {study.derivation.successor.g}</strong> · retention = {study.derivation.successor.retention}</p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="esg__section" id="readiness" aria-labelledby="readiness-title">
    <h2 id="readiness-title">{t('启动前我们已经验证了什么', 'What we validated before launch')}</h2>
    <p>{t('这些是“能不能按冻结机制安全运行”的资格证据，不是“方法是否更好”的效果证据。', 'These are qualification checks for whether the frozen mechanism can run safely, not efficacy evidence that the method is better.')}</p>
    <div class="esg__readiness-table-wrap"><table class="esg__readiness-table">
      <thead><tr><th>{t('检查', 'Check')}</th><th>{t('状态', 'Status')}</th><th>{t('边界', 'Boundary')}</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>{t('Gauge-invariant β policy', 'Gauge-invariant beta policy')}</td><td>PASS</td><td>Spearman {study.readiness.gaugeInvariantPolicy.heldoutSpearman.toFixed(3)}</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Round0 predict-only</td><td>PASS</td><td>{study.readiness.round0PredictOnly.optimizerSteps} steps · 0 writes</td></tr>
        <tr><td>{t('Round0 exact repeat', 'Round0 exact repeat')}</td><td>PASS</td><td>{study.readiness.isolatedExactStack.round0ExactRepeatCount} / {study.readiness.isolatedExactStack.round0ExactRepeatCount}</td></tr>
        <tr><td>{t('non-empty rank128 recurrent exact repeat', 'non-empty rank128 recurrent exact repeat')}</td><td>PASS</td><td>{study.readiness.isolatedExactStack.nonemptyExactRepeatCount} / {study.readiness.isolatedExactStack.nonemptyExactRepeatCount}</td></tr>
        <tr><td>{t('4-GPU zero-formal topology', '4-GPU zero-formal topology')}</td><td>PASS</td><td>formal rows = {study.readiness.topology.formalRowsConsumed}</td></tr>
        <tr><td>{t('历史正式资源通道', 'Historical formal resource lane')}</td><td>GPU4/5/7 + GPU6→GPU2</td><td>{t('共享池已退场；GPU4/5/7 覆盖全程，第四 lane 在后期迁到 GPU2', 'shared pool retired; GPU4/5/7 covered the run and the fourth lane migrated to GPU2 late in the study')}</td></tr>
        <tr><td>{t('per-step trace equivalence', 'per-step trace equivalence')}</td><td>PASS</td><td>{study.readiness.stepTrace.round0Steps} + {study.readiness.stepTrace.recurrentSteps} steps</td></tr>
        <tr><td>{t('短程非终评资格检查', 'short non-final qualification')}</td><td>PASS</td><td>{t('仅资格检查，不是效果结论', 'qualification only, not efficacy')}</td></tr>
        <tr><td>{t('formal matched dry-run', 'formal matched dry-run')}</td><td>PASS</td><td>{study.readiness.finalPrelaunch.dryRunStatus}</td></tr>
        <tr><td>{t('最终启动前检查', 'final consumer prelaunch')}</td><td>PASS</td><td>{t('历史预启动证据；owner 随后已授权正式启动', 'historical prelaunch evidence; the owner later authorized formal start')}</td></tr>
        <tr><td>{t('正式状态', 'Formal lifecycle')}</td><td>COMPLETE</td><td>{t('两条臂 160/160；配对 Stage2 seal PASS；终评已封存', 'both arms 160/160; paired Stage2 seal PASS; final evaluation sealed')}</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table></div>
    <p class="esg__qualification"><strong>{t('短程非终评资格结果原样记录：', 'Short non-final, reported as-is:')}</strong> reward Δ={study.readiness.shortNonFinal.rewardDelta.toFixed(4)}；success Δ=0.0000。{t('这是开发题上的资格检查，只说明机制能按冻结规则运行，不能写成正式效果结论。', 'This is a development-panel qualification-only result and cannot be presented as formal efficacy.')}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="esg__section" id="formal-design" aria-labelledby="formal-design-title">
    <h2 id="formal-design-title">{t('正式实验怎么比较', 'How the formal experiment compares the two arms')}</h2>
    <figure class="esg__pair" aria-label={t('正式配对对照设计', 'Formal matched-pair design')}>
      <div class="esg__pair-start"><strong>EMPTY_BOUNDED_HISTORY</strong><span>{t('共同起点', 'common start')}</span></div>
      <div class="esg__fork" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="esg__pair-arms">
        <div><strong>OFF · {study.identity.off}</strong><span>{t('只做 Bounded recurrence', 'Bounded recurrence only')}</span></div>
        <div><strong>ON · {study.identity.on}</strong><span>{t('同一训练 + Effective-State GDR 控制写入', 'same training + Effective-State GDR write')}</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="esg__arm-progress">
        <div><strong>OFF</strong><span>Round 0 → 1 → … → 159</span><span class="esg__arm-note">{t('只依赖 OFF 自己上一轮的封存状态', 'depends only on OFF’s own sealed predecessor')}</span></div>
        <div><strong>ON</strong><span>Round 0 → 1 → … → 159</span><span class="esg__arm-note">{t('只依赖 ON 自己上一轮的封存状态', 'depends only on ON’s own sealed predecessor')}</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="esg__audit-join"><span>{t('配对编号 / 审计记录', 'pair identity / audit receipt')}</span><strong>{t('两边都完成 160 轮后，重新合到最终配对分析', 'rejoin only after both arms finish all 160 rounds for final paired analysis')}</strong></div>
      <figcaption>{t('两条臂共享相同任务顺序、seed、预算和共同起点，但运行时不再互相等同一轮。GPU4–7 只是共享资源池；某一边暂时等 GPU，不会变成另一边的科学门槛。每轮的配对记录只用于异步审计，不负责放行下一轮。最终分析仍要求 OFF / ON 都封存 Round 0–159，并且 160 个配对都能核对。', 'The arms still share task order, seeds, budget, and common start, but they no longer wait for each other at the same runtime round. GPU4–7 is a shared resource pool; one arm waiting for GPU capacity does not become a scientific gate for the other. Pair receipts are asynchronous audit evidence, not progression gates. Final analysis still requires both OFF and ON to seal Rounds 0–159 and all 160 pairs to be auditable.')}</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <ul class="esg__matched-list">
      {study.formalDesign.matched.map((item) => <li>{zh ? item.zh : item.en}</li>)}
    </ul>
    <p><strong>{t('唯一处理差异：', 'Only treatment difference:')}</strong> {study.formalDesign.onlyTreatmentDifference}. {t('GDR 从 Round0 的第一条优化器更新开始生效；Round0 的 rollout 本身仍是共同起点下、处理生效前的行为。', 'GDR starts at the first optimizer update in Round0; the Round0 rollout itself is still pre-treatment behavior from the common start.')}</p>
    <p class="esg__boundary">{t('Completion-First：每个 Carrier 最多一次主调用，再加一次修复调用；如果只是内容不合格、但证据完整，就保留上一版（KEEP PRIOR / CONTENT_REJECTION_NOOP）并继续，不再多调用一次模型。只有身份、完整性或这一轮是否已经改变科学状态不确定时才停止并要求证据。资源占用记录丢失本身也不能当成“这一轮什么都没发生”的证据。', 'Completion-First: each Carrier gets at most one primary call plus one repair. A fully evidenced content rejection keeps the prior bytes and continues as CONTENT_REJECTION_NOOP, with no third model call. Identity, integrity, or uncertain scientific side effects still fail closed. Losing a resource lease is never treated as proof that no scientific side effect occurred.')}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="esg__section esg__results" id="formal-result" aria-labelledby="formal-result-title">
    <h2 id="formal-result-title">{t('正式结果', 'Formal result')}</h2>
    {pending ? (
      <>
