  <section class="esg__section" id="compute" aria-labelledby="compute-title">
    <h2 id="compute-title">{t('工程效率：Bounded 真正省掉了什么', 'Engineering efficiency: what Bounded actually removed')}</h2>
    <p>{t('旧 DirectApply 的 159 次 SD-LoRA trainer 累计约 31.09 小时。换成固定 rank128 的 Bounded state 后，参数 transition 累计降到 OFF 2.02 小时、ON 2.35 小时。这个 13–15× 只属于参数更新阶段，不是整个 Stage2 的 13–15×。', 'The 159 DirectApply SD-LoRA trainer updates total about 31.09 hours. With a fixed rank128 Bounded state, cumulative parameter-transition time falls to 2.02 hours for OFF and 2.35 hours for ON. This 13–15× gain applies to the parameter-update stage, not the entire Stage2 run.')}</p>
    <div class="esg__result-table-wrap"><table class="esg__result-table">
      <thead><tr><th>{t('时间口径', 'Timing denominator')}</th><th>DirectApply</th><th>Bounded OFF</th><th>Bounded + GDR ON</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>{t('参数更新 / trainer 累计', 'parameter update / trainer total')}</td><td>{study.timingComparison.directApply.trainerHours.toFixed(2)} h</td><td>{study.timingComparison.off.transitionHours.toFixed(2)} h</td><td>{study.timingComparison.on.transitionHours.toFixed(2)} h</td></tr>
        <tr><td>{t('相对 DirectApply', 'relative to DirectApply')}</td><td>1×</td><td>{(study.timingComparison.directApply.trainerHours / study.timingComparison.off.transitionHours).toFixed(1)}× {t('更快', 'faster')}</td><td>{(study.timingComparison.directApply.trainerHours / study.timingComparison.on.transitionHours).toFixed(1)}× {t('更快', 'faster')}</td></tr>
        <tr><td>{t('Stage2 墙钟跨度', 'Stage2 wall-clock span')}</td><td>{study.timingComparison.directApply.wallClockHours.toFixed(2)} h</td><td>{study.timingComparison.off.wallClockHours.toFixed(2)} h</td><td>{study.timingComparison.on.wallClockHours.toFixed(2)} h</td></tr>
        <tr><td>{t('rollout GPU-active', 'rollout GPU-active')}</td><td>{study.timingComparison.directApply.rolloutGpuActiveHours.toFixed(2)} GPU-h</td><td>{study.timingComparison.off.rolloutGpuActiveHours.toFixed(2)} GPU-h</td><td>{study.timingComparison.on.rolloutGpuActiveHours.toFixed(2)} GPU-h</td></tr>
        <tr><td>{t('可测总 GPU-active 下界', 'measured total GPU-active lower bound')}</td><td>{t('旧 run 未按同一资源收据口径封存', 'not sealed under the same accounting contract')}</td><td>{study.timingComparison.off.gpuActiveLowerBoundHours.toFixed(2)} GPU-h</td><td>{study.timingComparison.on.gpuActiveLowerBoundHours.toFixed(2)} GPU-h</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table></div>
    <p class="esg__boundary">{t('DirectApply trainer timer 与 Bounded transition timer都覆盖参数更新阶段，但执行实现与资源拓扑并不完全相同，所以这里是工程性能比较，不是科学 treatment 效果估计。', 'The DirectApply trainer timer and Bounded transition timer both cover the parameter-update stage, but implementation and resource topology are not identical. This is an engineering performance comparison, not a scientific treatment-effect estimate.')}</p>
  </section>

  <section class="esg__section" id="parameters" aria-labelledby="parameters-title">
    <h2 id="parameters-title">{t('参数体检：OFF 和 ON 到底变得有多大', 'Parameter check: how large did OFF and ON become')}</h2>
    <p>{t('两边都用 rank128、112 个 q/k/v/o LoRA 模块；只读后分析覆盖 160 轮 × 112 模块 = 每条 arm 17,920 行。下面只展示 R159 的几项最能回答“参数有没有整体爆掉”的指标。', 'Both arms use rank128 over 112 q/k/v/o LoRA modules. The read-only post-hoc covers 160 rounds × 112 modules = 17,920 module-round rows per arm. The table shows the R159 metrics most useful for asking whether the parameter state simply blew up.')}</p>
    <div class="esg__result-table-wrap"><table class="esg__result-table">
      <thead><tr><th>{t('R159 参数指标', 'R159 parameter metric')}</th><th>OFF</th><th>ON</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>{t('累积状态 Frobenius 范数', 'cumulative-state Frobenius norm')}</td><td>{study.parameterAnalysis.off.finalStateFrobenius.toFixed(3)}</td><td>{study.parameterAnalysis.on.finalStateFrobenius.toFixed(3)}</td></tr>
        <tr><td>{t('累积状态最大谱范数', 'cumulative-state max spectral norm')}</td><td>{study.parameterAnalysis.off.finalStateMaxSpectral.toFixed(3)}</td><td>{study.parameterAnalysis.on.finalStateMaxSpectral.toFixed(3)}</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Task Vector Frobenius</td><td>{study.parameterAnalysis.off.finalTaskVectorFrobenius.toFixed(3)}</td><td>{study.parameterAnalysis.on.finalTaskVectorFrobenius.toFixed(3)}</td></tr>
        <tr><td>{t('Task Vector 最大谱范数', 'Task Vector max spectral norm')}</td><td>{study.parameterAnalysis.off.finalTaskVectorMaxSpectral.toFixed(4)}</td><td>{study.parameterAnalysis.on.finalTaskVectorMaxSpectral.toFixed(4)}</td></tr>
        <tr><td>{t('参数稳定性 p95', 'parameter-stability p95')}</td><td>{study.parameterAnalysis.off.parameterStabilityP95.toFixed(4)}</td><td>{study.parameterAnalysis.on.parameterStabilityP95.toFixed(4)}</td></tr>
        <tr><td>{t('完整权重 / base 谱范数比 · 中位数', 'full/base spectral ratio · median')}</td><td>{study.parameterAnalysis.off.fullToBaseSpectralRatioMedian.toFixed(6)}</td><td>{study.parameterAnalysis.on.fullToBaseSpectralRatioMedian.toFixed(6)}</td></tr>
        <tr><td>{t('参与秩 · 中位数', 'participation rank · median')}</td><td>{study.parameterAnalysis.off.participationRankMedian.toFixed(2)}</td><td>{study.parameterAnalysis.on.participationRankMedian.toFixed(2)}</td></tr>
        <tr><td>rank95 · {t('中位数', 'median')}</td><td>{study.parameterAnalysis.off.rank95Median}</td><td>{study.parameterAnalysis.on.rank95Median}</td></tr>
